OL,3,GNEWSAPorbeagle shark washed up days
OL,4,Aafter whale deaths
OL,5,
OL,6,FA marine rescuer said more
OL,7,Finvestigations were needed after a
OL,8,Fshark was found dead on a beach soon
OL,9,Fafter six pilot whales died after
OL,10,Fbecoming stranded in the same area.
OL,12,FThe 6.5ft (2m) porbeagle shark was
OL,13,Ffound dead at Hadston Rocks, south of
OL,14,FAmble, Northumberland, on Thursday and
OL,15,Fhas since been recovered by British
OL,16,FDivers Marine Life Rescue (BDMLR) and
OL,17,FAmble fishermen.
OL,19,FEarlier in the week the six whales died
OL,20,Fafter a pod of about 40 distressed
OL,21,Fwhales was seen near Amble.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
